      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-which-websites-do-you-look-after"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Which websites do you look after?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Care fit</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-globe"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq1"><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-globe"/></svg></i><b>WordPress site</b><em>Yes</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-cart"/></svg></i><b>WooCommerce shop</b><em>Yes</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-code"/></svg></i><b>Built by Neeko</b><em>Yes</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-team"/></svg></i><b>Built by others</b><em>Check first</em></span><span class=x><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-x"/></svg></i><b>Non-WordPress</b><em>No</em></span></div></div></div><p>One WordPress website per plan, including WooCommerce shops. It’s made for sites whose original support period has ended. If someone else built your site, we check it first and tell you if anything needs fixing before care can start.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv open" id="faq-how-much-does-website-care-cost"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="true"><span>How much does website care cost?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Prices</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-card"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="xsq2"><div><b>Care</b><small>Backup + updates · health check · 1 h</small><em>RM199/mo</em></div><div class="on"><b>Care Plus</b><small>Health + security checks · 3 h</small><em>RM399/mo</em></div><div><b>Priority</b><small>Health + security checks · 6 h · priority queue</small><em>RM699/mo</em></div></div></div></div><p>Care is RM199 a month for 1 WordPress website, with a monthly backup and updates, a basic health check, up to 1 support hour and changes to existing content. Care Plus is RM399 with the backup and update cycle, health and security checks, up to 3 support hours and minor troubleshooting. Priority is RM699 with up to 6 support hours and a priority work queue.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-happens-each-month"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What happens each month?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Each month</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-cal"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq5"><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Backup of files and database</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>WordPress, theme and plugin updates</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Key pages checked afterwards</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>Health check (and security checks from Care Plus)</p><p><em><svg class="igck" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.5 6.2 5 8.5l4.5-5"/></svg></em>A short monthly report</p></div></div></div><p>We back up your site, update WordPress, the theme and plugins, check your key pages afterwards and run a health check, plus security checks from Care Plus. You get a short report with what was done and anything that needs attention.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-can-i-use-support-hours-for"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What can I use support hours for?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Support hours</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq3"><p><span><b>Content changes</b><small>Text, prices, photos, opening hours</small></span><em class="g">Yes</em></p><p><span><b>Small fixes</b><small>Forms, links, layout glitches</small></span><em class="g">Yes</em></p><p><span><b>New pages or features</b><small>Quoted separately</small></span><em class="g">Quoted</em></p></div></div></div><p>Changes to existing content, like text, prices, photos or opening hours, and small fixes such as a form that stopped sending. New pages, new features and major compatibility work are quoted separately. Support is in business hours and unused hours don’t roll over to the next month.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-is-there-24-7-emergency-support"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Is there 24/7 emergency support?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Response</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq3"><p><span><b>Business hours</b><small>Mon–Fri, 9–6</small></span><em class="g">All plans</em></p><p><span><b>Priority queue</b><small>Your requests go first</small></span><em class="g">Priority</em></p><p><span><b>24/7 emergency SLA</b><small>Not included</small></span><em class="g">No</em></p></div></div></div><p>No. Website care runs in business hours and doesn’t include a 24/7 emergency SLA. With the Priority plan, your requests go to the front of our work queue.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-is-hosting-included"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>Is hosting included?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Separate</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-globe"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq1"><span class=x><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-globe"/></svg></i><b>Hosting</b><em>Separate</em></span><span class=x><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-tag"/></svg></i><b>Domain renewal</b><em>Separate</em></span><span class=x><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></i><b>Plugin licences</b><em>Separate</em></span><span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clock"/></svg></i><b>Renewal reminders</b><em>Included</em></span></div></div></div><p>No. Hosting, domain renewals and premium plugin licences are paid to your providers. We keep track of the dates and remind you before they’re due.</p></div></div></article>
      <article class="fqc rv" id="faq-what-happens-if-an-update-breaks-something"><button class="fqq" type="button" aria-expanded="false"><span>What happens if an update breaks something?</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></button><div class="fqx"><div><div class="pv"><div class="wg"><div class="wt"><span>Rollback</span><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg></i><i><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-ne"/></svg></i></div><div class="igq4"><p class="h"><i>!</i><span><b>Cart button missing after an update</b><small>Restored from the backup taken first</small></span></p><div class="igq4b"><span>Details</span><span class="b"><span class="igsw "><span class="a">Restore</span><span class="b">Restored ✓</span></span></span></div></div></div></div><p>We always back up before updating, so we can put back the last working version quickly. Then we fix the cause within your support hours, or hold that update until the plugin is patched. If the fix needs major compatibility work, we quote it first.</p></div></div></article>
